<translate>
'''Vehicle Events API''' provides extra [[Lua event]] triggered during various vehicle interactions:
* Getting in and out of the vehicle
* Engine and power
* Driving
* Lights and sounds
* Alarm, keys and locks
* Doors and windows
* Parts and tires
* Cargo and towing

</translate>
